  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened capacity of member States to ratify and apply international labour standards and to fulfil their reporting obligations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ILO will continue to support Kazakhstan&#x2019;s constituents to strengthen alignment of national legislation and practices with ratified ILO instruments with a focus on freedom of association and collective bargaining instruments and other fundamentals. ILO will further provide technical assistance to improve the system for collective disputes resolution and strengthen the culture of social dialogue and freedom of association at the sectoral and enterprise level. ILO will provide technical guidance to the constituents and relevant stakeholders for improvement of the labour code and law on trade unions in line with the international labour standards.</narrative>
  </description>
